Moderation systems evaluate messages.

Communities operate through relationships.

## Product
TEMPER combines interaction structure with persistent community memory.

## Proof
Same words.

Same graph.

Different history.

Different decision.

## Architecture
Observer → Convergence → Mind → Intervention → Outcome → Memory.

## Demo
Show Maya and Chris.

Avoid generic hackathon marketing language.

